  "factor_name": "DXY-Stress Residual Reversal",
  "version": "1.0",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "clip(-residual_return_1d * (1 + 0.35 * abs(robust_zscore(DXY_return_1d, 60d)), -0.2, 0.2)",
    "description": "For each tradable asset, subtract its rolling 60-day beta to the cross-asset median return from its one-day return, then take the contrarian residual signal. Magnify reversals during unusually large DXY moves using a clipped rolling median/MAD robust z-score. DXY is observation-only and never traded."
